        "quote": "(a) Each alarm user shall be required to register any alarm system with the Fire Chief or designee before the alarm system is activated or placed into service; except that alarm systems placed into service before the effective date of this chapter shall be registered within 30 days of the effective date. A separate alarm registration is required for each premises served by the alarm system. Alarm system registrations are nontransferable.",
